    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Fistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502172903\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fistarqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Fistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502172903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"932\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fistarqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fistarqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>醉拳大师</b> \n</p><p>一位以酒之精灵附体施展变幻莫测攻击技巧的武术大师。\n最初，她为了宣传当地酿造的酒而召唤酒之精灵进行表演，并作为美丽斗士而声名鹊起。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/5d/SFistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240502173112\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SFistarqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/5d/SFistarqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240502173112\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"980\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SFistarqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SFistarqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dd/Fistar_DM_Bartender_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251217232715\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fistar DM Bartender Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dd/Fistar_DM_Bartender_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251217232715\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"952\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fistar DM Bartender Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fistar_DM_Bartender_Queen%27s_Blade